\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Angelic Collection\
Inspired by the symbolism of Chamuel\'97the angel of love\'97the Angelic Collection celebrates the kind of love that protects, guides and remains by our side.\
Each design carries subtle elements of wings, halos and embracing curves. Rather than presenting these symbols literally, they are refined into graceful lines, hidden details and carefully engineered structures.\
From the front, every piece feels timeless and elegant. From another angle, a wing, a heart or a protective embrace is revealed\'97creating a private meaning known only to the person wearing it.\
Made to mark proposals, anniversaries, personal milestones and the people we never want to forget, the Angelic Collection is a reminder that true love is not only something we feel.\
It is something we carry with us.\
CHAMUEL&CO.\uc0\u8232 Where Stories Become Jewelry.\
